    "e979351750656a28ceb9022db535b158c7cfbbed9e0d6b93872050c8b7499f47": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "df66065b033cf4e251c9a274f8db24b91f30603f5f9b20dc519b114712c34fdf",
      "contextFingerprint": "e9093554dc643c5c23a6bfa4748c805b2dfd17209467563878eb8f50b81b2b46",
      "sourceText": "例如，其他条件都满足时：同一个坡上的点，若被算成比这一小片地面高6 cm，会低于当前10 cm障碍门槛；若地面高度估计偏低，把它算成高15 cm，就可能被画成障碍。这里是**局部地面高度差，不是整条坡的总高度**。调整地面估计或抬高障碍门槛，可能减少坡面误判，也可能让真实低障碍被忽略，不能只看坡能不能通过。",
      "translatedText": "For example, when all other conditions are met: a point on the same slope, if calculated as 6 cm higher than this small patch of ground, will be below the current 10 cm obstacle threshold; if the ground height is underestimated and it is calculated as 15 cm higher, it may be drawn as an obstacle\\. This is**local ground height difference, not the total height of the entire slope**\\. Adjusting the ground estimate or raising the obstacle threshold may reduce slope misjudgments, but may also cause real low obstacles to be ignored; you cannot judge only by whether the slope can be passed\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 226,
        "outputTokens": 130,
        "costUsd": 0.000224
      }
    },
